<section xml:id="_overview_philosophy">
<title>🎯 Overview &amp; Philosophy</title>
<simpara><emphasis role="strong">Mello-Workspace (MWS)</emphasis> bridges the gap between intent and action. Designed for developers, power users, and neurodivergent workflows (ADHD focus management, time-blindness mitigation), MWS provides consistent muscle memory, multi-monitor window control, intelligent text replacements, and hardware-accelerated context routing.</simpara>
<simpara>Unlike traditional launchers, MWS acts as an ambient automation layer that dynamically adapts across local displays, multi-monitor setups, and remote sessions (RDP/Hyper-V).</simpara>
<tip>
<simpara>MWS eliminates hardcoded absolute paths by resolving applications dynamically through Windows COM <literal>shell:AppsFolder</literal> namespaces and standard Windows environment variables.</simpara>
</tip>
<simpara><?asciidoc-hr?></simpara>
</section>
