</informalfigure>
<simpara>Hit <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>Win</keycap><keycap>F1</keycap></keycombo> to access the tabbed <emphasis role="strong">Help &amp; About</emphasis> dashboard:
* <emphasis role="strong">Live System Metrics:</emphasis> Hostname, current user, OS build, CPU core topology, RAM capacity, and uptime.
