<section xml:id="_customization_extensibility">
<title>⚙️ Customization &amp; Extensibility</title>
<simpara>MWS is architected to keep your personal configurations clean and separated from version control.</simpara>
<programlisting language="autohotkey" linenumbering="unnumbered">; Custom overrides in custom/.mslrc.ahk or custom/_custom_functions.ahk

; Example: Add a custom workspace shortcut
^!j::MsgBox("Custom workspace action executed!")

; Example: Personal snippet
:*::myemail::developer@domain.com</programlisting>
<important>
<simpara>Do not modify core files in <literal>lib/</literal> directly for personal macros. Instead, add your routines to <literal>custom/_custom_functions.ahk</literal> or <literal>.mslrc.ahk</literal>. These files are ignored by git and will never conflict with upstream updates.</simpara>
</important>
<simpara><?asciidoc-hr?></simpara>
</section>
<section xml:id="_project_architecture">
<title>📂 Project Architecture</title>
<programlisting language="text" linenumbering="unnumbered">VT-Mello-Workspace/
├── 📄 Mello-Workspace.ahk       &lt;-- Application entry point and orchestrator
├── 📄 Mello-Workspace.ps1       &lt;-- Dual-mode installation &amp; deployment engine
├── 📄 CHANGELOG.adoc            &lt;-- Version history &amp; release notes
├── 📄 README.adoc               &lt;-- Comprehensive documentation
├── 📁 ahkbin/                   &lt;-- Portable AutoHotkey v2 binaries &amp; WindowSpy
├── 📁 custom/                   &lt;-- User-defined overrides and personal hotstrings
│   └── 📄 _custom_functions.ahk
├── 📁 lib/                      &lt;-- Modular subsystem libraries
│   ├── 📄 app-automate.ahk      &lt;-- App launching &amp; shell COM automation
│   ├── 📄 arpeggios.ahk         &lt;-- Modal sequence HUD &amp; grid management
│   ├── 📄 cursor-mgmt.ahk       &lt;-- Real-time cursor scaling engine
│   ├── 📄 help_about.ahk        &lt;-- Help GUI &amp; ThisSystem.Info telemetry
│   ├── 📄 hotkeys-core.ahk      &lt;-- Core system shortcuts &amp; suspend exemptions
│   ├── 📄 hotstrings-mgmt.ahk   &lt;-- Unicode boxes, trees, kaomojis, and text macros
│   ├── 📄 traymenu.ahk          &lt;-- Context-aware system tray &amp; theme engine
│   └── 📄 winui-mgmt.ahk        &lt;-- Window snapping, sizing &amp; mouse gestures
├── 📁 media/                    &lt;-- Icons, audio assets, and UI imagery
└── 📁 scripts/                  &lt;-- Developer provisioning &amp; testing scripts</programlisting>
